            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<p><strong>Expert-Backed Wellness, Everyday Benefits</strong></p><p>What athletes prioritize for performance can benefit everyone. Air wellness supports:</p><ul><li>Easier breathing</li><li>Better rest</li><li>Improved daily comfort</li></ul><p>Blueair technology is built on science and performance — trusted not just by athletes, but by anyone who values health and well-being.</p><p><strong>Learning From the Best</strong></p><p>The same principles that help athletes perform at the highest level can help families, professionals, and communities feel better every day. Air wellness isn’t exclusive — it’s essential.</p>",
